#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:116
msgid "Transparent Sorting"
msgstr "Transparent sortering"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:121
msgid "Per Triangle"
msgstr "Per triangel"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:123
msgid ""
"Sort transparent polygons per triangle. Fast but may produce graphical "
"glitches"
msgstr ""
"Sortera transparenta polygoner per triangel. Snabbt men kan orsaka grafiska "
"fel"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:125
msgid "Per Strip"
msgstr "Per remsa"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:127
msgid ""
"Sort transparent polygons per strip. Faster but may produce graphical "
"glitches"
msgstr ""
"Sortera transparenta polygoner per remsa. Snabbare men kan producera "
"grafiska artefakter"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:131
msgid "Per Pixel"
msgstr "Per pixel"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:133
msgid "Sort transparent polygons per pixel. Slower but accurate"
msgstr "Sortera transparenta polygoner per pixel. Långsammare men exakt"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:153
msgid "Rendering Options"
msgstr "Renderingsalternativ"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:156
msgid "Half"
msgstr "Halv"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:156 core/ui/settings_network.cpp:40
msgid "Native"
msgstr "Inbyggd"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:201
msgid "Internal Resolution"
msgstr "Intern upplösning"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:203
msgid ""
"Internal render resolution. Higher is better, but more demanding on the GPU."
" Values higher than your display resolution (but no more than double your "
"display resolution) can be used for supersampling, which provides high-"
"quality antialiasing without reducing sharpness."
msgstr ""
"Intern renderingsupplösning. Ju högre desto bättre, men desto högre krav på "
"GPU:n. Värden som är högre än din skärmupplösning (men inte mer än dubbelt "
"så höga som din skärmupplösning) kan användas för supersampling, vilket ger "
"högkvalitativ antialiasing utan att skärpan minskar."

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:204
msgid "Integer Scaling"
msgstr "Heltalsskalning"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:204
msgid ""
"Scales the output by the maximum integer multiple allowed by the display "
"resolution."
msgstr ""
"Skalar utdata med det maximala heltal som tillåts av skärmupplösningen."

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:205
msgid "Linear Interpolation"
msgstr "Linjär interpolering"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:205
msgid ""
"Scales the output with linear interpolation. Will use nearest neighbor "
"interpolation otherwise. Disable with integer scaling."
msgstr ""
"Skalar utdata med linjär interpolering. Annars används närmaste "
"granninterpolering. Inaktivera med heltalsskalning."

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:207
msgid "VSync"
msgstr "VSync"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:207
msgid "Synchronizes the frame rate with the screen refresh rate. Recommended"
msgstr ""
"Synkroniserar bildfrekvensen med skärmens uppdateringsfrekvens. "
"Rekommenderas"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:212
msgid "Frame Pacing (Experimental)"
msgstr "Bildrutetakt (experimentell)"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:213
msgid ""
"Provide the GPU with presentation timing for each frame to replicate "
"original frame pacing."
msgstr ""
"Ger grafikprocessorn presentationstid för varje bildruta för att efterlikna "
"den ursprungliga bildrutetakten."

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:216
msgid "Duplicate frames"
msgstr "Duplikata bildrutor"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:216
msgid "Duplicate frames on high refresh rate monitors (120 Hz and higher)"
msgstr ""
"Duplikata bildrutor på skärmar med hög uppdatingsfrekvens (120 Hz och högre)"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:221
msgid "Show VMU In-game"
msgstr "Visa VMU i spelet"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:221
msgid "Show the VMU LCD screens while in-game"
msgstr "Visa VMU-LCD-skärmarna i spelet"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:222
msgid "Full Framebuffer Emulation"
msgstr "Fullständig emulering av framebuffer"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:223
msgid ""
"Fully accurate VRAM framebuffer emulation. Helps games that directly access "
"the framebuffer for special effects. Very slow and incompatible with "
"upscaling and wide screen."
msgstr ""
"Helt korrekt VRAM-rambuffertemulering. Hjälper spel som direkt använder "
"rambuffert för specialeffekter. Mycket långsam och oförenlig med uppskalning"
" och bredbild."

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:227
msgid "Load Custom Textures"
msgstr "Läs in anpassade texturer"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:228
msgid "Load custom/high-res textures from data/textures/<game id>"
msgstr "Läs in anpassade/högupplösta texturer från data/textures/<game id>"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:232
msgid "Preload Custom Textures"
msgstr "Förinläs anpassade texturer"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:233
msgid ""
"Preload custom textures at game start. May improve performance but increases"
" memory usage"
msgstr ""
"Förinläs anpassade texturer vid spelstart. Kan förbättra prestandan men ökar"
" minnesanvändningen"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:239
msgid "Aspect Ratio"
msgstr "Bildförhållande"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:241
msgid "Widescreen"
msgstr "Bredbild"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:242
msgid ""
"Draw geometry outside of the normal 4:3 aspect ratio. May produce graphical glitches in the revealed areas.\n"
"Aspect Fit and shows the full 16:9 content."
msgstr ""
"Rita geometri utanför det normala bildförhållandet 4:3. Kan orsaka grafiska fel i de synliga områdena.\n"
"Bildanpassning och visar hela innehållet i 16:9."

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:247
msgid "Super Widescreen"
msgstr "Superbredbild"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:248
msgid ""
"Use the full width of the screen or window when its aspect ratio is greater than 16:9.\n"
"Aspect Fill and remove black bars. Not compatible with integer scaling."
msgstr ""
"Använd hela skärmens eller fönstrets bredd när bildförhållandet är större än 16:9.\n"
"Bildfyllning och ta bort svarta fält. Inte kompatibelt med heltalsskalning."

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:251
msgid "Widescreen Game Cheats"
msgstr "Fusk för bredbildsspel"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:252
msgid ""
"Modify the game so that it displays in 16:9 anamorphic format and use "
"horizontal screen stretching. Only some games are supported."
msgstr ""
"Ändra spelet så att det visas i 16:9 anamorfiskt format och använd "
"horisontell skärmutsträckning. Endast vissa spel stöds."

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:253
msgid "Horizontal Stretching"
msgstr "Horisontell utsträckning"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:254
msgid "Stretch the screen horizontally"
msgstr "Sträck ut skärmen horisontellt"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:255
msgid "Rotate Screen 90°"
msgstr "Rotera skärm 90°"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:255
msgid "Rotate the screen 90° counterclockwise"
msgstr "Rotera skärmen 90° motsols"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:260
msgid "Per Pixel Settings"
msgstr "Inställningar per pixel"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:263
msgid "512 MB"
msgstr "512 MB"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:263
msgid "1 GB"
msgstr "1 GB"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:263
msgid "2 GB"
msgstr "2 GB"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:263
msgid "4 GB"
msgstr "4 GB"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:301
msgid "Pixel Buffer Size"
msgstr "Storlek för pixelbuffert"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:303
msgid ""
"The size of the pixel buffer. May need to be increased when upscaling by a "
"large factor."
msgstr ""
"Storleken för pixelbufferten. Kan behöva att ökas vid större uppskalningar."

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:305
msgid "Maximum Layers"
msgstr "Maximala lager"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:306
msgid ""
"Maximum number of transparent layers. May need to be increased for some "
"complex scenes. Decreasing it may improve performance."
msgstr ""
"Maximalt antal transparenta lager. Kan behöva att ökas för vissa komplexa "
"scener. Minska det kan förbättra prestandan."

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:309
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "Prestanda"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:311
msgid "Automatic Frame Skipping:"
msgstr "Hoppa automatiskt över bildrutor:"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:313 core/ui/settings_video.cpp:338
#: core/ui/settings_network.cpp:89
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Inaktiverad"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:313
msgid "No frame skipping"
msgstr "Hoppa inte över bildrutor"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:315
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Normal"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:315
msgid "Skip a frame when the GPU and CPU are both running slow"
msgstr "Hoppa över en bildruta när GPU och CPU båda kör långsamt"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:317
msgid "Maximum"
msgstr "Maximal"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:317
msgid "Skip a frame when the GPU is running slow"
msgstr "Hoppa över en bildruta när GPU kör långsamt"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:320
msgid "Frame Skipping"
msgstr "Hoppa över bildrutor"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:321
msgid "Number of frames to skip between two actually rendered frames"
msgstr ""
"Antal bildrutor att hoppa över mellan två faktiskt renderade bildrutor"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:322
msgid "Shadows"
msgstr "Skuggor"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:323
msgid "Enable modifier volumes, usually used for shadows"
msgstr "Aktivera modifieringsvolymer, oftast använda för skuggor"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:324
msgid "Fog"
msgstr "Dimma"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:324
msgid "Enable fog effects"
msgstr "Aktivera dimmeffekter"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:327 core/ui/settings.cpp:311
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Avancerat"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:329
msgid "Delay Frame Swapping"
msgstr "Fördröj växling av bildrutor"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:330
msgid ""
"Useful to avoid flashing screen or glitchy videos. Not recommended on slow "
"platforms"
msgstr ""
"Användbart för att undvika blinkande skärm eller hackiga videor. "
"Rekommenderas inte på långsamma plattformar"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:331
msgid "Fix Upscale Bleeding Edge"
msgstr "Fixa blödande kant vid uppskalning"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:332
msgid ""
"Helps with texture bleeding case when upscaling. Disabling it can help if "
"pixels are warping when upscaling in 2D games (MVC2, CVS, KOF, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"Hjälper till med texturblödning vid uppskalning. Att inaktivera den kan "
"hjälpa om pixlarna förvrängs vid uppskalning i 2D-spel (MVC2, CVS, KOF, "
"etc.)"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:333
msgid "Native Depth Interpolation"
msgstr "Inbyggd djupinterpolering"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:334
msgid ""
"Helps with texture corruption and depth issues on AMD GPUs. Can also help "
"Intel GPUs in some cases."
msgstr ""
"Hjälper till med texturförvrängning och djupproblem på AMD-"
"grafikprocessorer. Kan även hjälpa Intel-grafikprocessorer i vissa fall."

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:335
msgid "Copy Rendered Textures to VRAM"
msgstr "Kopiera renderade texturer till VRAM"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:336
msgid "Copy rendered-to textures back to VRAM. Slower but accurate"
msgstr ""
"Kopiera renderade-till-texturer tillbaka till VRAM. Långsammare men exakta"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:375
msgid "Anisotropic Filtering"
msgstr "Anisotropisk filtrering"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:377
msgid ""
"Higher values make textures viewed at oblique angles look sharper, but are "
"more demanding on the GPU. This option only has a visible impact on "
"mipmapped textures."
msgstr ""
"Högre värden gör att texturer som ses i sneda vinklar ser skarpare ut, men "
"ställer högre krav på GPU:n. Det här alternativet har bara en synlig effekt "
"på mipmappade texturer."

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:379
msgid "Texture Filtering:"
msgstr "Texturfiltrering:"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:381 core/ui/settings_general.cpp:231
#: core/ui/settings_general.cpp:235 core/ui/settings_general.cpp:240
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Standard"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:381
msgid "Use the game's default texture filtering"
msgstr "Använd spelets standardfiltrering för texturer"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:383
msgid "Force Nearest-Neighbor"
msgstr "Tvinga närmaste granne"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:383
msgid ""
"Force nearest-neighbor filtering for all textures. Crisper appearance, but "
"may cause various rendering issues. This option usually does not affect "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"Tvinga närmaste grannfiltrering för alla texturer. Skarpare utseende, men "
"kan orsaka olika renderingsproblem. Det här alternativet påverkar vanligtvis"
" inte prestandan."

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:385
msgid "Force Linear"
msgstr "Tvinga linjär"

#: core/ui/settings_video.cpp:385
msgid ""
"Force linear filtering for all textures. Smoother appearance, but may cause "
"various rendering issues. This option usually does not affect performance."
msgstr ""
"Tvinga linjär filtrering för alla texturer. Jämnare utseende, men kan orsaka"
" olika renderingsproblem. Det här alternativet påverkar vanligtvis inte "
"prestandan."

